WEBVTT

00:03:26.521 --> 00:03:30.061
yetim bolaga vasiylik qilib, uni 
jamiyatning yuqori qatlamiga olib kiradi,

00:03:30.061 --> 00:03:32.700
uning qarshisida yangi 
imkoniyatlar eshigini ochadi.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.289
Hayotdan maqsad izlagan Pip

00:03:34.289 --> 00:03:37.690
o'zgalarning xohish-istaklari 
qurboniga aylanadi va

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.817
shubhali kishilar bilan 
aloqa qilishiga to'g'ri keladi.

00:03:40.817 --> 00:03:43.250
Dikkensning ko'plab 
qahramonlari singari

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.769
bechora Pip ham taqdir o'yinlariga 
ro'baro' keladi.

00:03:46.769 --> 00:03:49.278
Shu bois Dikkensni o'qish

00:03:49.278 --> 00:03:51.269
kitobxon uchun maroqli,

00:03:51.269 --> 00:03:54.765
ammo uning qahramonlari 
uchun og'ir sinovdir.

00:03:54.765 --> 00:03:58.719
Dikkens odatda romanlari oxirida 
jumboq yechimini keltiradi,

00:03:58.719 --> 00:04:02.449
ammo "Edvin Drud siri" bundan istisno.